OL,4,Acurious horse and a postbox topper
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe love to feature your photographs
OL,7,Fshowing the beauty of the West Midlands
OL,8,Fin all kinds of ways.
OL,10,FThis week, we have a range of animals
OL,11,Fon show, some Halloween run photos and
OL,12,Feven a postbox topper!
OL,14,FYou can be part of future galleries
OL,15,Fwith your own photos of the area -
OL,16,Fupload your images via BBC Weather
OL,17,FWatchers or email us at
OL,18,Fmidlandstoday@bbc.co.uk.
OL,20,FFor inspiration, view some top tips
OL,21,Fhere from three of England's Big
OL,22,FPicture photographers.
